Focus your will into a powerful thrust of your telekinetically-wielded weapon to impale your target and then viciously rip it free.

This deals [199%, 219%, 235%, 248%, 260% (TL1-5)] weapon damage and then causes the victim to bleed for [209, 282, 339, 386, 429 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage over four turns.

At level 3 the thrust is so powerful that it has [18%, 48%, 63%, 72%, 78% (TL1-5)] chance to shatter a random temporary magical or psionic damage absorbing shield if one exists.

The bleeding damage increases with your Mindpower.
